{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cf1843c1-c0ee-802a-bcad-8a3c5d3054a4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T08:37:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, City of Newport Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, madam. My name is Jose Valdez. I am calling about a parking ticket that I received, and I would like to ask about it. Kindly bear with me, I have you on the speakerphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, Mr. Valdez. Can you tell me the ticket number, or the plate number on the vehicle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the ticket here in front of me. [pause] The number is, um, it is written very small. I will read the plate instead, if that is acceptable."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plate is fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is two, seven, four, one, Kilo, Echo. Two seven four one K E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. One moment while I pull that up. [pause] I see it. It was issued on a Tuesday morning for a violation of the winter parking ban."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:35:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is the one. I wish to say that the street was never plowed, and there was no sign posted that I could see. I walked the whole block afterward. Kindly note that in the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can note your statement on the account. To dispute it, the ticket is reviewed on the basis of the officer's information and any photograph that was taken. Do you want to contest it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do wish to contest it. But first I would like to see the photograph of the violation. Is it possible to have it sent to me by email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, if there is a photo attached to the citation, we can email it. What email address should I use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...it is jose, that is J-O-S-E, then valdez, V-A-L-D-E-Z, and then the number forty-one, at a mail service. I am sorry, the line broke up. Shall I repeat it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please repeat the part after the number forty-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. After the forty-one, it is the at sign, and then the word gmail, G-M-A-I-L, dot com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. J-O-S-E V-A-L-D-E-Z four-one at gmail dot com. I'll send the photo request over today, and it should arrive within a few business days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:36:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I should explain that I may be slow in answering, because I am also helping a young boy, a teenager, to fill out his first job application. It takes some time with the questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. The dispute deadline is printed on the ticket, so keep an eye on that date. Once you've seen the photo, you can call back or respond in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. And if I need to reach you again, my number is four zero one, five five five, zero one six four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have that noted. Anything else today, Mr. Valdez?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:37:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for your help, madam. Good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T08:37:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good day to you."
    }
  ],
